OL,3,AWarren Buffett steps down after six
OL,4,Adecades at Berkshire - 'Father Time
OL,5,Aalways wins'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarren Buffett has stepped down as
OL,8,Fchairman of Berkshire Hathaway, handing
OL,9,Fover leadership to his son Howard in
OL,10,Fthe final chapter of a long-planned
OL,11,Ftransition at the US business giant.
OL,13,FAt 96, the world-famous investor will
OL,14,Fmove into an advisory role as chairman
OL,15,Femeritus and remain on the company
OL,16,Fboard to offer his "judgement and
OL,17,Fperspective", according to a letter to
OL,18,Fshareholders.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
