OL,3,AWarren Buffett steps down after six
OL,4,Adecades at Berkshire - 'Father Time
OL,5,Aalways wins'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision comes nine months after
OL,8,FBuffett passed the chief executive role
OL,9,Fto Greg Abel, with his son, Howard, who
OL,10,Fhas been a director since 1993, taking
OL,11,Fover non-executive board duties.
OL,13,FKnown as the "Oracle of Omaha," Buffett
OL,14,Fbuilt one of the most successful
OL,15,Finvestment track records in modern
OL,16,Fhistory.
